133
00:06:36,160 --> 00:06:39,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, how did he find us out?</font>

134
00:06:40,170 --> 00:06:42,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't it because there
are too many of us?</font>

135
00:06:43,500 --> 00:06:46,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If the presence is erased,
the number of people shouldn't matter!</font>

136
00:06:46,550 --> 00:06:49,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Or... have you forgotten the Jutsu?
Sakura-ch-</font>

137
00:06:49,840 --> 00:06:51,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's you!</font>

138
00:06:51,890 --> 00:06:54,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It will be good training to shadow him.</font>

139
00:06:54,810 --> 00:06:56,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From now on,
we'll go about it individually.</font>

140
00:06:56,770 --> 00:07:00,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-Yeah, let's just leave Naruto here!</font>

141
00:07:00,940 --> 00:07:01,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

142
00:07:05,440 --> 00:07:10,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And Junko then says...
"Oh, I am losing you."</font>

143
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:24,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? What?</font>

144
00:07:34,300 --> 00:07:35,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He got away...</font>

145
00:07:35,720 --> 00:07:37,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Clumsy as usual...</font>

146
00:07:37,810 --> 00:07:39,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You idiot...</font>

147
00:07:39,810 --> 00:07:40,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry.</font>

148
00:07:51,150 --> 00:07:54,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gosh, what is Kakashi-sensei doing?</font>

149
00:07:54,120 --> 00:07:56,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He hasn't moved for
such a long time...</font>

150
00:07:58,490 --> 00:07:59,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way!</font>

151
00:08:21,600 --> 00:08:22,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun! How did it go?!</font>

152
00:08:24,810 --> 00:08:26,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No more shadowing.</font>

153
00:08:37,240 --> 00:08:38,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Off we go!</font>

154
00:08:39,410 --> 00:08:41,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Today's mission is to help at a farm.</font>

155
00:08:42,370 --> 00:08:44,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The mission itself is not a big deal.</font>

156
00:08:44,830 --> 00:08:47,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're definitely going to look at it...</font>

157
00:08:47,540 --> 00:08:49,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Kakashi-sensei's real face!
— Kakashi-sensei's real face!</font>

158
00:08:52,550 --> 00:08:53,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter?</font>

159
00:08:53,970 --> 00:08:55,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys seem to have
lots of energy today.</font>

160
00:08:56,050 --> 00:08:58,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— I have lots of energy!
— I'm ready to go!</font>

161
00:08:59,760 --> 00:09:02,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, that's excellent.</font>

162
00:09:06,270 --> 00:09:08,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've finally found you...</font>

163
00:09:11,400 --> 00:09:13,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hatake Kakashi!</font>

164
00:09:15,610 --> 00:09:17,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi...</font>

165
00:09:18,410 --> 00:09:20,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It has been a long while,</font>

166
00:09:20,240 --> 00:09:22,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but I will settle
my long-standing grudge!</font>

167
00:09:22,950 --> 00:09:24,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Boss, what is your grudge?</font>

168
00:09:26,250 --> 00:09:28,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fool! Have you forgotten?!</font>

169
00:09:29,380 --> 00:09:30,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I cannot forget.</font>

170
00:09:31,050 --> 00:09:34,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It happened in the spring
of three years ago...</font>

171
00:09:34,010 --> 00:09:35,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No!</font>

172
00:09:35,220 --> 00:09:37,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't need to be that scared.</font>

173
00:09:37,800 --> 00:09:39,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No!</font>

174
00:09:40,050 --> 00:09:43,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Our boss says he has something
to talk to you about...</font>

175
00:09:44,390 --> 00:09:45,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your boss?!</font>

176
00:09:56,320 --> 00:09:59,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I love you... Please marry me!</font>

177
00:09:59,620 --> 00:10:01,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Boss is so cool!
— Boss is so cool!</font>

178
00:10:01,660 --> 00:10:02,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No...</font>

179
00:10:02,740 --> 00:10:04,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no need to be embarrassed.</font>

180
00:10:04,830 --> 00:10:08,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can be honest and
fly into my arms.</font>

181
00:10:10,290 --> 00:10:11,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No...</font>

182
00:10:11,920 --> 00:10:14,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't worry.
Even though I look like this,</font>

183
00:10:15,260 --> 00:10:17,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have a tidy sum of money!</font>

184
00:10:17,010 --> 00:10:18,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am telling you, no!</font>

185
00:10:19,140 --> 00:10:22,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? You're turning me down
in these surroundings?</font>

186
00:10:23,510 --> 00:10:25,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When I say no, I mean no!</font>

187
00:10:25,980 --> 00:10:29,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I made it such a romantic setting,
but why?</font>

188
00:10:29,400 --> 00:10:31,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't like what I don't like!</font>

189
00:10:31,400 --> 00:10:33,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why don't you stop it around there?</font>

190
00:10:33,650 --> 00:10:34,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Huh?
— Huh?</font>

191
00:10:37,150 --> 00:10:40,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, the girl doesn't like it
and no matter how you look at it,</font>

192
00:10:40,740 --> 00:10:42,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you're being rejected, buddy.</font>

193
00:10:43,120 --> 00:10:44,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, yeah.</font>

194
00:10:44,490 --> 00:10:46,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're pretty gutsy.</font>

195
00:10:46,830 --> 00:10:49,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you understand who we are?!</font>

196
00:10:50,290 --> 00:10:53,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you challenging us, knowing that
we are the Moya Ninja Threesome...</font>

197
00:10:53,750 --> 00:10:55,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">fearsome enough to silence
a crying child?!</font>

198
00:10:56,300 --> 00:10:58,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Moya Ninja? Never heard of it.</font>

199
00:10:59,180 --> 00:11:01,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't know Moya Ninja?!</font>

200
00:11:01,340 --> 00:11:03,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How dare you make fools of us!</font>

201
00:11:03,680 --> 00:11:05,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who the hell are you?</font>

202
00:11:05,560 --> 00:11:07,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not worth enough to introduce, but...</font>

203
00:11:08,100 --> 00:11:10,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, my name is Hatake Kakashi.</font>

204
00:11:10,100 --> 00:11:11,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— You're introducing yourself!
— You're introducing yourself!</font>

205
00:11:12,020 --> 00:11:12,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey you...</font>

206
00:11:12,980 --> 00:11:14,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're going to regret it.</font>

207
00:11:14,650 --> 00:11:17,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For getting in the way of
someone's romance!</font>

208
00:11:18,320 --> 00:11:19,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Romance?</font>

209
00:11:20,240 --> 00:11:22,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't it just an annoying,
one-sided love?</font>

210
00:11:23,200 --> 00:11:24,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Enough!</font>

211
00:11:25,280 --> 00:11:27,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Men! We're going to attack!</font>

212
00:11:27,120 --> 00:11:28,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Yes, sir!
— Yes, sir!</font>

213
00:11:28,080 --> 00:11:30,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">4... 3... 2... 1...</font>

214
00:11:30,540 --> 00:11:32,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Hustle! Hustle!
— Hustle! Hustle!</font>

215
00:11:41,340 --> 00:11:44,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please! Somebody help me!</font>

216
00:11:44,220 --> 00:11:45,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! I can't stand heights!</font>

217
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:46,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll take you back to the village.</font>

218
00:11:46,760 --> 00:11:47,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop talking! Hey!</font>

219
00:11:47,770 --> 00:11:50,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, quit sighing!
What, are you just leaving us here?!</font>

220
00:11:51,850 --> 00:11:54,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's how it went...</font>

221
00:11:54,100 --> 00:11:55,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Don't be so proud!
— Don't be so proud!</font>

222
00:11:55,110 --> 00:11:56,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— You lost!
— You lost!</font>

223
00:11:56,900 --> 00:11:59,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So it means revenge from
three years ago!</font>

224
00:11:59,570 --> 00:12:01,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Boss has become stronger
in the last three years,</font>

225
00:12:01,740 --> 00:12:04,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and he's going to beat him up
in a face-to-face match!</font>

226
00:12:04,820 --> 00:12:06,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's so dramatic!</font>

227
00:12:07,490 --> 00:12:10,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fool! Who would take such risk?!</font>

228
00:12:10,500 --> 00:12:11,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

229
00:12:12,210 --> 00:12:13,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we're going to do it,</font>

230
00:12:13,330 --> 00:12:16,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we'll do it stealthily from
the shadows! Stealthily.</font>

231
00:12:18,250 --> 00:12:20,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— D-Dirty!
— D-Dirty!</font>

232
00:12:22,380 --> 00:12:23,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Welcome!</font>

233
00:12:23,800 --> 00:12:26,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Welcome! Welcome! Welcome!</font>

234
00:12:26,680 --> 00:12:27,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Welcome!</font>

235
00:12:34,270 --> 00:12:35,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Incredible!</font>

236
00:12:35,980 --> 00:12:37,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Looks delicious!</font>

237
00:12:37,400 --> 00:12:38,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How extravagant.</font>

238
00:12:40,230 --> 00:12:41,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please take your time...</font>

239
00:12:47,450 --> 00:12:49,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi...</font>

240
00:12:49,080 --> 00:12:51,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now eat, this will be
your last dinner party.</font>

241
00:12:52,750 --> 00:12:55,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That meal contains
a tasteless and odorless medicine</font>

242
00:12:55,420 --> 00:12:58,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that causes uncontrollable hiccups.</font>

243
00:12:59,090 --> 00:13:03,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just keep on having
the ceaseless hiccups and die suffering!</font>

244
00:13:04,590 --> 00:13:07,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a fitting end for you!</font>

245
00:13:10,260 --> 00:13:12,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Something wrong?</font>

246
00:13:13,230 --> 00:13:14,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not one of you has
even laid chopsticks on the food.</font>

247
00:13:15,100 --> 00:13:19,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not really, but why don't you,
Kakashi-sensei, hurry up and eat?</font>

248
00:13:19,440 --> 00:13:22,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I'm on a diet.</font>

249
00:13:22,610 --> 00:13:24,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Figured he'd say something like that.</font>

250
00:13:24,900 --> 00:13:28,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then I'll strip off that mask
if it kills me!</font>

251
00:13:30,080 --> 00:13:31,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My hands slipped...</font>

252
00:13:46,720 --> 00:13:48,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How could you!</font>

253
00:13:48,340 --> 00:13:50,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, sorry, sorry, I unintentionally...</font>

254
00:13:50,600 --> 00:13:52,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— What do you mean "unintentionally"?!
— What do you mean "unintentionally"?!</font>

255
00:13:53,140 --> 00:13:55,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a pity! The meal...</font>

256
00:13:55,850 --> 00:13:58,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— How could he do such a thing?!
— How could he do such a thing?!</font>

257
00:14:01,020 --> 00:14:02,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, what's the next move?</font>

258
00:14:03,070 --> 00:14:05,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't worry. I have an idea.</font>

259
00:14:06,320 --> 00:14:07,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— An idea?
— An idea?</font>

260
00:14:14,700 --> 00:14:17,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see, this is pretty good thinking
for Sasuke.</font>

261
00:14:17,920 --> 00:14:20,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A person would normally
take off the mask here.</font>

262
00:14:20,330 --> 00:14:22,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Never mind that.
Just be quiet, you idiot!</font>

263
00:14:26,970 --> 00:14:29,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi, you will die here!</font>

264
00:14:30,300 --> 00:14:32,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From this needle on the blowpipe arrow,</font>

265
00:14:32,550 --> 00:14:36,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">coated with medicine I prepared
that will make you laugh uncontrollably...</font>

266
00:14:49,530 --> 00:14:51,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll die laughing...</font>

267
00:14:51,820 --> 00:14:54,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is the fitting way for you...</font>

268
00:14:55,160 --> 00:14:56,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn...</font>

269
00:14:56,250 --> 00:15:00,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wanted to see it too,
but this is a hot spring...</font>

270
00:15:01,250 --> 00:15:02,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I want to see!</font>

271
00:15:05,000 --> 00:15:06,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi-sensei!
Aren't you ready yet?</font>

272
00:15:06,960 --> 00:15:09,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, I'm coming in now.</font>

273
00:15:09,840 --> 00:15:10,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I do want to see it!</font>

274
00:15:15,260 --> 00:15:17,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Here he comes!
— Great!</font>

275
00:15:17,980 --> 00:15:19,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, I can't see at all!</font>

276
00:15:34,240 --> 00:15:38,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks for waiting.
I'll just soak for a little while.</font>

277
00:15:40,410 --> 00:15:42,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Why is it like this?!
— Why is it like this?!</font>

278
00:15:42,330 --> 00:15:43,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now!</font>

279
00:15:43,880 --> 00:15:45,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Something wrong?</font>

280
00:15:46,340 --> 00:15:48,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And slowly, I sink in.</font>

281
00:15:59,310 --> 00:16:01,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the...?!</font>

282
00:16:01,940 --> 00:16:04,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened?
I want to know!</font>

283
00:16:11,450 --> 00:16:16,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What in the world is
Kakashi-sensei thinking? Huh?</font>

284
00:16:24,420 --> 00:16:27,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn, I'm completely flushed... Huh?</font>

285
00:16:29,550 --> 00:16:31,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Our clothes are gone!
— Our clothes are gone!</font>

286
00:16:40,600 --> 00:16:43,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please come again!
Please come again!</font>

287
00:16:43,270 --> 00:16:44,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you for coming!</font>

288
00:16:44,310 --> 00:16:47,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please come again!
Please come again!</font>

289
00:16:47,980 --> 00:16:52,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Crap... I'm going to
definitely defeat you, Hatake Kakashi.</font>

290
00:16:52,650 --> 00:16:56,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it was great that
we brought spare clothes.</font>

291
00:16:56,570 --> 00:17:00,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder who took them away...?
Our clothes!</font>

292
00:17:00,950 --> 00:17:04,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right,
each of you work at your own posts.</font>

293
00:17:05,120 --> 00:17:06,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now, break up.</font>

294
00:17:08,250 --> 00:17:10,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't stand it anymore...</font>

295
00:17:10,050 --> 00:17:12,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have too much stress stored inside.</font>

296
00:17:12,840 --> 00:17:15,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm almost at the end of
my patience as well...</font>

297
00:17:15,760 --> 00:17:18,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun... actually, me too...</font>

298
00:17:19,260 --> 00:17:22,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, it's the last resort!</font>

299
00:17:22,520 --> 00:17:23,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Last resort?
— Last resort?</font>

300
00:17:25,350 --> 00:17:26,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is this?</font>

301
00:17:26,140 --> 00:17:29,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can't you see? It's a Shinobi outfit.</font>

302
00:17:29,440 --> 00:17:31,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When did you get this ready?</font>

303
00:17:31,530 --> 00:17:34,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, well, never mind that,
never mind that.</font>

304
00:17:34,240 --> 00:17:35,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you do with this?</font>

305
00:17:37,820 --> 00:17:40,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll strip away the mask.
Even if we have to use force!</font>

306
00:17:46,000 --> 00:17:47,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn Kakashi...</font>

307
00:17:47,250 --> 00:17:48,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Boss! Look at that!</font>

308
00:17:51,130 --> 00:17:52,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Hatake Kakashi!</font>

309
00:17:53,420 --> 00:17:56,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, what are you guys up to?</font>

310
00:17:56,220 --> 00:17:59,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What are you talking about?
We are simply Ninja.</font>

311
00:17:59,720 --> 00:18:02,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It is not that we want to see
what is behind your mask...!</font>

312
00:18:02,060 --> 00:18:05,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fool! Don't say unnecessary things!</font>

313
00:18:05,430 --> 00:18:06,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's...!</font>

314
00:18:06,890 --> 00:18:11,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Boss! There's somebody else besides you
who holds a grudge on Kakashi!</font>

315
00:18:11,020 --> 00:18:12,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now is the chance!</font>

316
00:18:12,610 --> 00:18:13,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right! Let's go!</font>

317
00:18:13,980 --> 00:18:14,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Right!
— Right!</font>

318
00:18:15,440 --> 00:18:16,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop right there!</font>

319
00:18:19,660 --> 00:18:22,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi! It's time for you
to pay for your crime!</font>

320
00:18:23,910 --> 00:18:24,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You shall die!</font>

321
00:18:24,870 --> 00:18:29,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With this medicine I prepared
that will make you cry... What?!</font>

322
00:18:31,630 --> 00:18:35,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, just when I thought how long
you guys were going to sneak around...</font>

323
00:18:36,050 --> 00:18:38,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you finally come out.</font>

324
00:18:38,130 --> 00:18:39,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ah, well, you know...</font>

325
00:18:40,680 --> 00:18:43,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But before that,
Sasuke, Sakura, Naruto!</font>

326
00:18:45,020 --> 00:18:47,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are you guys dressed like that?</font>

327
00:18:47,480 --> 00:18:49,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?! Well, yeah, so...</font>

328
00:18:50,440 --> 00:18:51,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh no...</font>

329
00:18:51,520 --> 00:18:53,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We have to make up an explanation,
whatever it is!</font>

330
00:18:54,520 --> 00:18:55,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Caught you!</font>

331
00:18:55,860 --> 00:19:00,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We were well aware that
you three were targeting Kakashi-sensei!</font>

332
00:19:00,450 --> 00:19:06,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! Then our plot was exposed
from the beginning!</font>

333
00:19:06,240 --> 00:19:10,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course!
This was a trap to lure you guys out!</font>

334
00:19:10,210 --> 00:19:11,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We caught you off guard!</font>

335
00:19:11,920 --> 00:19:14,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So we were completely caught
in the trap.</font>

336
00:19:14,540 --> 00:19:17,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! We underestimated you,
thinking it was kids!</font>

337
00:19:18,130 --> 00:19:19,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I never heard that story!</font>

338
00:19:20,220 --> 00:19:21,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nice, Sakura!</font>

339
00:19:21,970 --> 00:19:26,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't quite get what's happening,
but oh well...</font>

340
00:19:30,020 --> 00:19:32,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Please forgive us!
— Please forgive us!</font>

341
00:19:33,110 --> 00:19:34,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no use talking...</font>

342
00:19:35,110 --> 00:19:37,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— O-Oh no!
— S-Stop!</font>

343
00:19:44,320 --> 00:19:46,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the same as three years ago!</font>

344
00:19:46,740 --> 00:19:51,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This time, we're hung by just one rope,
combined with the same movement.</font>

345
00:19:51,460 --> 00:19:54,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By the way, who are you guys?</font>

346
00:19:54,210 --> 00:19:56,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— And he doesn't even remember us!
— And he doesn't even remember us!</font>

347
00:20:04,050 --> 00:20:05,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Kakashi-sensei.</font>

348
00:20:06,300 --> 00:20:07,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah?</font>

349
00:20:07,260 --> 00:20:09,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is behind that mask?</font>

350
00:20:09,890 --> 00:20:12,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? You wanted to see
what's behind this mask?</font>

351
00:20:12,520 --> 00:20:13,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

352
00:20:13,350 --> 00:20:15,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then you should have said
that from the beginning...</font>

353
00:20:15,650 --> 00:20:17,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, can you show us?</font>

354
00:20:18,150 --> 00:20:19,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't mind...</font>

355
00:20:19,400 --> 00:20:20,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the...?!</font>

356
00:20:20,440 --> 00:20:21,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sure thing.</font>

357
00:20:25,320 --> 00:20:26,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right...</font>

358
00:20:30,200 --> 00:20:31,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is it like cod roe?</font>

359
00:20:34,960 --> 00:20:35,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Buckteeth?</font>

360
00:20:39,250 --> 00:20:40,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Or a tiny mouth?</font>

361
00:20:41,050 --> 00:20:43,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Behind this mask...</font>

362
00:20:43,260 --> 00:20:45,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Behind that mask...
— Behind that mask...</font>

363
00:20:47,680 --> 00:20:50,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There happens to be another mask!</font>

364
00:20:50,560 --> 00:20:51,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— What?!
— What?!</font>

365
00:20:56,480 --> 00:20:57,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...?!</font>

366
00:20:58,360 --> 00:21:00,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What in the world is that?!</font>

367
00:21:06,090 --> 00:21:11,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>I BELIEVE YOUR PROMISE ITS TRUE HEART TO GIVE ME COURAGE</b></font></font>

368
00:21:06,090 --> 00:21:11,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>I believe your promise, it's a true heart gives me courage</b></font></font>

369
00:21:11,140 --> 00:21:16,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ALWAYS I FEEL IT THE PRECIOUS TIME WITH YOU</b></font></font>

370
00:21:11,140 --> 00:21:16,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>always I feel it the precious time with you</b></font></font>

371
00:21:16,110 --> 00:21:20,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>tachidomatta kado ni</b></font></font>

372
00:21:16,110 --> 00:21:20,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>on your still shoulder</b></font></font>

373
00:21:20,920 --> 00:21:25,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>asu e mukau kaze wo kanjiteta</b></font></font>

374
00:21:20,920 --> 00:21:25,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>I feel the wind that blows towards tomorrow</b></font></font>

375
00:21:25,550 --> 00:21:31,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>machi no akari hoshikuzu mitai ni</b></font></font>

376
00:21:25,550 --> 00:21:31,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>the city lights are like pieces of stars</b></font></font>

377
00:21:31,490 --> 00:21:36,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>futari tsutsumu kedo</b></font></font>

378
00:21:31,490 --> 00:21:36,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>that hold us together</b></font></font>

379
00:21:36,160 --> 00:21:45,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>sorezore ni chigau kagayaki ga aru to</b></font></font>

380
00:21:36,160 --> 00:21:45,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>"each one of us glows differently"</b></font></font>

381
00:21:45,470 --> 00:21:48,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>warau kimi ga</b></font></font>

382
00:21:45,470 --> 00:21:48,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>you say laughingly</b></font></font>

383
00:21:48,350 --> 00:21:54,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ichiban mabushiku mieru yo</b></font></font>

384
00:21:48,350 --> 00:21:54,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>but you look most dazzling</b></font></font>

385
00:21:54,620 --> 00:21:59,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>yume wa ryuusei no you ni</b></font></font>

386
00:21:54,620 --> 00:21:59,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>like a comet</b></font></font>

387
00:21:59,050 --> 00:22:05,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ameagari no niji no you ni</b></font></font>

388
00:21:59,050 --> 00:22:05,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>like the rainbow after the storm</b></font></font>

389
00:22:05,200 --> 00:22:13,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>kono kokoro ni hikari wo tsuretekuru</b></font></font>

390
00:22:05,200 --> 00:22:13,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>you bring light into my heart</b></font></font>

391
00:22:13,400 --> 00:22:24,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>nayami tsuzukeru koto ga hitotsu no kotae ni naruyo</b></font></font>

392
00:22:13,400 --> 00:22:24,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>being lost can be the answer</b></font></font>

393
00:22:24,080 --> 00:22:31,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>gomakashitari shinai to chikau no</b></font></font>

394
00:22:24,080 --> 00:22:31,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>let's promise we won't cheat</b></font></font>

395
00:22:31,520 --> 00:22:36,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ALWAYS I FEEL IT THE PRECIOUS TIME WITH YOU</b></font></font>

396
00:22:31,520 --> 00:22:36,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>always I feel it the precious time with you</b></font></font>

397
00:22:38,540 --> 00:22:41,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Begging your pardon!
Begging your pardon!</font>

398
00:22:41,130 --> 00:22:45,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I was born and raised in the Leaf Village
in the Land of Fire.</font>

399
00:22:45,090 --> 00:22:47,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">My given name is Naruto,
and the surname is Uzumaki.</font>

400
00:22:47,170 --> 00:22:47,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">People call me...</font>

401
00:22:47,920 --> 00:22:49,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">"The No. 1 Hyperactive
Knucklehead Ninja"!</font>

402
00:22:49,050 --> 00:22:50,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I'm not "the No. 1 Hyperactive"
Knucklehead Ninja"!</font>

403
00:22:50,970 --> 00:22:53,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">What's this
you've been practicing?</font>

404
00:22:53,600 --> 00:22:56,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">We're going to meet with
Boss Wasabi.</font>

405
00:22:56,220 --> 00:22:59,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">A proper first greeting's important!</font>

406
00:22:59,560 --> 00:23:04,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"Come Now, New Mission. Save the Obligation, The Sympathy and the Country of Tea!"</font>

